# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/window-next four-card DEVELOPMENT window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/window-next and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. A placeholder in @...@ is filled in by whoever drives the window (@K64J_GRAFT_DIR@ and @K64J_TTNNCPP_SHA256@: the K64j graft directory and its binary's
# digest); every other value is final. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1 is the placeholder every template carries (sed -i 's/tp4-next-1/<tag>/' *.env); these one-card jobs run the harness in its own pinned image
# and mount this checkout's scripts as the code under test, so they do not need B0's image. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# AN EVIDENCE JOB, ONE CARD: the cardm action (C2_CARDS=pair: cardm is a pair-shaped step) runs one harness on card M alone; the quad jobs reset all four boards, this one never does.
# NO NEW GRAFT: octo-T8 changes no K64j kernel and no factory. 0x21 (tail | extent) is an existing K64j flag set - CB1 qualified it at G8B2 and G4B3, one KV head - and the octo block's
# bundle of ONE eight-row group (G8B1) is that program at B = 1. The graft is the SERVED one: the same _ttnncpp.so the C2 image carries (docker/qwen-c2-serving.Dockerfile), pinned by
# EXPECT_TTNNCPP_SHA256 - read the launched argv, a graft mounted is not a graft executed. What no card has run is the bundle of one eight-row group; that is what Q1 qualifies.
# Q1a (CB1 at the octo geometry, EVIDENCE): K1/K3 at ONE eight-row group per bundle, flags 0x21: N, X (K1's six families, the starts +0 +7 +127 +240 +255, seeds 0-4: the runtime extent
# at cur_pos E - 1 on the poisoned C-wide table == the compile-time call at capacity E, bit for bit), L (a dead control decides nothing) and T (one program captured once, replayed over more
# than 50 families with the words and the narrow mask rewritten between replays; the fence trace). READ: 'K64J_CARD verdict=PASS ... extent=<n>/<n> ... trace=<n>/<n> fence=<n>/<n> ... geometry=G8B1'
# with every liveness control moved. Duration (estimate): 3-6 min. Stop rule: any differing decisive comparison stops the window (no fallback under the strict policy).
C2_CARDS=pair
C2_ACTIONS=cardm
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1
C2_CARDM_HARNESS=optimisation/ttnn-op/k64j/run_card_b.sh
C2_CARDM_ARGS=--kv-heads 1 --octo --sections N,X,L,T --seeds 0,1,2,3,4 --no-timing
C2_CARDM_ENV=K64J_HARNESS=card KOPGRAFT64=@K64J_GRAFT_DIR@ EXPECT_TTNNCPP_SHA256=@K64J_TTNNCPP_SHA256@
